-	系数至多乘 $k^2$), 故
-	$\|K_c^r x^k\|_0 \le (r+1)(1+c)^r k^{2r}\|x^k\|_0
-	\le C_r k^{2r-1/2}$. 取 $\beta_t = 2r - 1/2 = \lceil t\rceil - 1/2$ (当
-	$t$ 恰为偶数时取 $\beta_t = t - 1/2$, 更强). \qed
-\end{proof}
