-\begin{theorem}[等距传输]\label{thm:transport}
-	对一切实数 $s$, $K_c: (H^s, (\cdot,\cdot)_s) \to
-	(H^{s-2}, (\cdot,\cdot)_{s-2})$ 是等距线性同构, 且
